      "title": "P316 STYLE-ONLY ASSET PROMPT — PASTE CSV ROW PROMPT HERE",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "TASK\nGenerate ONE production asset for Premiere316 using the asset prompt pasted below. The content, identity, object design, setting, category, pose, shot type, and composition must come from the asset prompt only.\n\nSTYLE-ONLY REFERENCE RULE\nThe loaded reference images are STYLE REFERENCES ONLY. They are not content references. Use them only for cinematic art direction: warm divine-gold light, smoky black-brown underworld atmosphere, high-end live-action photorealism, lens language, deep contrast, realistic skin/fabric/material texture, ember haze, film grain, and sacred epic tone.\n\nDO NOT COPY FROM STYLE REFERENCES\nDo not copy the Jesus identity, beard, face, hairline, white burial robe, glowing sword, spear wound, nail wounds, blood placement, sandals/barefoot requirement, four-view layout, gates of hell, crowds, demons, architecture, pose, or story content unless the asset prompt explicitly asks for those exact things. No content borrowing. No accidental Jesus lookalike. No automatic sword. No automatic white robe. No automatic crucifixion wounds. No automatic hell background.\n\nASSET PROMPT — PASTE COMPLETE CURRENT GENERATION PROMPT FROM THE CSV ROW BELOW\n{PASTE_ROW_COMPLETE_CURRENT_GENERATION_PROMPT_HERE}\n\nUNIVERSAL PREMIERE316 STYLE LOCK\nPhotorealistic live-action feature-film production reference, sacred cinematic realism, premium large-format cinema camera language, warm golden divine key light, dark smoky umber shadows, restrained ember highlights, physically coherent global illumination, natural contact shadows, subtle atmospheric depth, exact anatomy when humans are present, believable material physics, detailed practical textures, realistic dust/cloth/metal/stone/skin, high dynamic range without artificial HDR, sharp subject details, soft background depth, controlled film grain, no cheap fantasy illustration, no cartoon, no anime, no plastic CGI, no glossy game render.\n\nCATEGORY BEHAVIOR\nFor character, wardrobe, prop, artifact, location, crowd, atmosphere/VFX, guide-frame, and graphic image assets: follow the row prompt exactly and use this style lock only as art direction.\nFor voice, sound design, and music rows: do not generate an image here; use the included AUDIO_PROMPT_STYLE_BRIDGE.md to translate this visual style into audio language.\n\nOUTPUT RULES\nNo captions, no watermarks, no logos, no UI, no accidental letters, no border frames, no extra graphic elements unless the row prompt explicitly requires a graphic deliverable. Keep the asset clean enough to use as a production reference or guide frame."
      ],
