      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "HOW TO USE\n\n1. Copy the included CI_STYLE_REF_*.png files into ComfyUI/input.\n2. Drag this workflow PNG into ComfyUI, or open the JSON.\n3. Paste one row's Complete Current Generation Prompt into the orange prompt node.\n4. Keep the row prompt as content source-of-truth. The references are intentionally abstract/cropped style plates only.\n5. Queue Prompt.\n\nDefault active style refs: 1, 2, and 3. Optional refs 4–6 are bypassed by default so they do not inject content into unrelated assets."
      ],
      "color": "#4a3c20",
      "bgcolor": "#6a572e",
      "title": "QUICK START — STYLE ONLY"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        -1120,
        2070
      ],
      "size": [
        530,
        260
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 35,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "SIZE PRESETS\n\n4X3: general production assets and design refs.\n16X9: guide frames, locations, crowd shots, atmosphere/VFX, cinematic stills.\n2X3: character portraits, wardrobe studies, hero prop verticals.\n\nChange WIDTH and HEIGHT together. Keep dimensions divisible by 32. The 2X branch doubles the native output."
      ],
      "color": "#4a3c20",
      "bgcolor": "#6a572e",
      "title": "SIZE PRESETS / CATEGORY USE"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        -520,
        2070
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        220
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 36,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "STYLE-ONLY LOCK\n\nThe CI_STYLE_REF images are deliberately blurred/cropped/abstracted to transfer art direction without pulling identity or scene content.\n\nDo NOT load the original Jesus images into this workflow for batch assets unless that exact asset is Jesus. For other characters/assets, use only the style plates plus the row prompt."
      ],
      "color": "#4a3c20",
      "bgcolor": "#6a572e",
      "title": "CRITICAL — STYLE ONLY, NOT CONTENT"
    },
